{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778975589612,"sessionID":"ses_1cccce2a6ffeGfzsOIz23No5hc","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_kDOiqLtU47BMGgpd2lZ3qG62","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+I updated the hypertrophic chondrocyte definition/comment, added the requested logical links to hypertrophic cartilage zone and endochondral ossification, and removed the outdated terminally differentiated wording.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+## Summary\n+\n+Updated `CL_0000743` hypertrophic chondrocyte in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+## Changes\n+\n+- Replaced the outdated textual definition to remove terminally differentiated wording.\n+- Replaced the old open question comment with a literature-backed comment about survival, dedifferentiation, and transdifferentiation.\n+- Added `term_tracker_item` annotation for issue #3506.\n+- Added declarations for externally referenced `GO_0001958` and `UBERON_0008187`.\n+- Added subclass axioms:\n+- `part of some UBERON_0008187` hypertrophic cartilage zone.\n+- `capable of some GO_0001958` endochondral ossification.\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+The revised definition follows the issue request and is supported by PMID:25321476 and PMID:35179487. The replacement comment captures the newer lineage-tracing evidence from PMID:35179487 and PMID:41207902.\n+\n+OLS identified `UBERON:0008187` as hypertrophic cartilage zone and `GO:0001958` as endochondral ossification.\n+\n+## Validation\n+\n+- Checked the existing `CL_0000743` axioms in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Checked PubMed pages for PMID:25321476, PMID:35179487, and PMID:41207902.\n+- Ran `robot convert -vvv -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit.ofn` successfully.\n+\n+## Checklist\n+\n+- [x] Read imported issue context.\n+- [x] Verified existing term and requested pa